--- b2 medium.en: Meet Carol and Ben. Carol turns 65 this spring, and she is about to choose her very first Medicare coverage. Ben is 68, he has a Medicare Advantage plan, and he is wondering whether to return to original Medicare and add a Medigap plan. Both of them are about to meet rules that most people only learn after it is too late.
